{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of <strong>serene underwater beauty</strong> with <i>Zen\u00a0Aquarium</i>, the ultimate <strong>idle fish tank experience</strong> inspired by classic aquarium screensavers. No complex setups, no management stress, just <strong>pure visual enjoyment</strong> as a thriving aquatic world unfolds before your eyes. Perfect for ASMR lovers, chill gamers, and anyone who wants a peaceful, living desktop companion.<br><br><strong>\u2757\u00a0Disclaimer: Zen Aquarium does not support ultrawide resolutions (21:9, 32:9)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc20 Watch Your Aquarium Come to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New fish spawn and gracefully swim through your tank at regular intervals, creating an ever-evolving scene of <strong>harmony and tranquility</strong>. With <strong>simple and</strong>\u00a0<strong>unique aquarium setups</strong> and <strong>many mesmerizing fish species</strong>, no two moments are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0a The Ultimate Zen &amp; ASMR Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>relaxation and mindfulness</strong>, <i>Zen</i>\u00a0<i>Aquarium </i> offers a <strong>soothing escape</strong> from the noise of everyday life. Let the gentle motion of fish, the soft bubbling of water, and the ambient aquatic sounds create a <strong>perfect stress-free atmosphere</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc1f Endless Combinations, Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your perfect aquatic atmosphere with a <strong>wide selection</strong> of ambient sounds and calming music. Whether you prefer gentle rainfall, soft wind, or even cozy cat purring, <i>Zen Aquarium</i> gives you full control. Mix and layer audio to create a <strong>unique soundscape</strong> that suits your mood\u2014ideal for subtle background ambiance or full sensory immersion. Every session is a chance to discover a new combination, making each visit to your aquarium uniquely relaxing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f No Stress, Just Serenity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional aquarium sims, <i>Zen\u00a0Aquarium\u00a0</i>is all about <strong>relaxation, not management</strong>. There\u2019s no need to feed fish, clean tanks, or adjust water levels\u2014just <strong>sit back, unwind, and enjoy the mesmerizing world beneath the surface</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.poster.avif?t=1765294905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.webm?t=1765294905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.mp4?t=1765294905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.poster.avif?t=1765294905\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.webm?t=1765294905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.mp4?t=1765294905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extr